<div class="rn">
<h2>What&#x27;s New in 6.3</h2>
<h3 class="hl">Highlights</h3>
<ul class="highlights">
<li><strong>Resume in Ghostty.</strong> Choose Ghostty under Preferences → General → Terminal App for CLI Resume, including Codex. Resume opens a new window in the session folder. Requires a Ghostty build with AppleScript support; verified with Ghostty 1.4.0. Contributed by @buildfolk in #89.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Pressing Esc in OpenCode no longer hides its rate.</strong> An OpenCode step you interrupt before any output used to blank that session&#x27;s rate in the Quota Meter for 30 minutes, and mark its Session Info token total as incomplete. It now counts as no usage, like a refused request.</li>
</ul>
<p class="more">Full release notes: <a href="https://github.com/jazzyalex/agent-sessions/releases/tag/v6.3">https://github.com/jazzyalex/agent-sessions/releases/tag/v6.3</a></p>
</div>
